nest abstain+route arm. (`DESCRIPTION.md:9`)\n- The **only** positive VERIFIED lift Increment-1 demonstrates is the A4 literal-computation path (NS9 / NS3-computational). (`DESCRIPTION.md:9`)\n- Honesty stamp from Stage-1 convergence: `cross_model:false verified:true` â€” single-family Sharks/Judge; ceiling = CLAIMED on proof/conceptual claims; correlated-blind-spot register **FLAGGED, not mitigated**. (`DESCRIPTION.md:15`)\n\n**Build-host contract (win32)**\n- Test gate is `node --test test/` per wave â€” **no shell, no PowerShell** (host has no pwsh). (`DESCRIPTION.md:18`, `IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md:3`)\n- P9 firewall = a child `node test/sandbox-runner.mjs` via `execFile` (not a shell), evaluating over **exact arithmetic (bigint/rational, no float)** in a per-call hermetic temp dir; re-execution compares a SHA-256 of canonical stdout. (`DESCRIPTION.md:19`)\n- Inherited modules resolved via a pinned `inherits.manifest.json`; **authoring that manifest is Wave 2's first deliverable** and the Wave-2 A0.5a gate fails fast on any mismatch. (`DESCRIPTION.md:20`)\n\n**Pinned required-before-build residuals (value Â· owner-wave Â· terminus)**\n- **A0.5a** inheritance gate â€” Wave 2. (`DESCRIPTION.md:23`)\n- **R1** oracle roster + per-class k/kâ€²/FP tolerance â€” Waves 24 (corpus) + 25 (scoring); 6 defect classes Ã— â‰¥3 instances; derivation/dimensional/off-by-one = 100% catch floor. (`DESCRIPTION.md:24`)\n- **Metric G** = catch-rate âˆ’ FP-rate over the SCORED SUBSET; acceptance `G(battery-on) > G(better stub) + 0.30 strict` + ablation lower + 100% abstain floor â€” Wave 25. (`DESCRIPTION.md:25`)\n- **S1** CONTROL thresholds (budget 8 steps; ABANDON via gap-function before step 8) â€” Wave 17. (`DESCRIPTION.md:26`)\n- **S4** ref-fn-independence invariant â€” Wave 11. (`DESCRIPTION.md:27`)\n- **P3** example-space-stability (advisory-only) â€” Wave 20. (`DESCRIPTION.md:28`)\n- **P7** default-deny grammar + battery + recall â€” Waves 8/9 (+24/25). (`DESCRIPTION.md:29`)\n- **P9** provenance-binding (durable monotone single-use nonce, persist-ordered-before-validity) â€” Wave 4 (+ Wave-2 round-trip). (`DESCRIPTION.md:30`)\n- **P8** SMT/cross-family integrity â€” **deferred to Increment-2 / Phase F.** (`DESCRIPTION.md:31`)\n\n**Increment-2 (HALT-gated, not in this wave list)**\n- North-Star **Phase F** (F0 env probe â†’ F1 cross-family model verifier â†’ F2 Lean â†’ F3 SMT certifier â†’ F4 commission dispatch â†’ F5 human gate). Builds **only on explicit user promotion** after an F0 liveness+integrity probe; the full pinned Phase-F plan is the next Crucible/Foreman pass. (`DESCRIPTION.md:33-34`)\n\n**Wave-graph shape (linear dependency chain, 27 waves)**\n- Spine first (W1 SKILL stub â†’ W2 inheritance gate â†’ W3 ledger â†’ W4 artifact substrate â†’ W5 conformance â†’ W6 canaries â†’ W7 router â†’ W8â€“9 autonomous-VERIFIED gate), then the six pillars (W10â€“23), then the gradeable oracle + journal + full SKILL.md (W24â€“27). Each wave ships real source its `node --test` tests exercise; non-trivial waves carry Given/When/Then. (`IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md:14-177`)\n\n**Net:** the trio (researchPrime â†’ Crucible â†’ Foreman) has carried Ramanujan through research and both Crucible stages to a frozen, well-formed, **Foreman-ready** v3 doc-trio; the next action is Foreman executing Wave 1, with the empty Execution Log as the build's starting ledger."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14200,"cache_read_input_tokens":33793,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14200},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8f6972a5-2091-45c6-8728-36cdd0587885","uuid":"582eede7-ed24-4b9f-83ba-703e6e1a251c","request_id":"req_011CcKGtfUyB8XLg5883f4XZ"}
